  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models with PCA and ResNet50 have ~0.526 accuracy, but uncertainty remains about whether modality interaction or fusion strategies provide value. Testing a pure RNA-only model (config_001) isolates the effect of modality choice, providing critical comparison to determine if multimodal approaches offer meaningful improvement. This addresses key uncertainty about baseline performance and the necessity of multimodal integration."
}

